//   if (!canWirelessPair) show only: Connect with root · Connect with Shizuku · Computer activation
//
// Manifest: ACCESS_BACKGROUND_LOCATION / FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE etc. are ignored on
// API 29 and are harmless; FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE requires targetSdk 34 handling only.
